/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
|  column13/0/feed -- sour water on the apparent component basis.               |
|                                                                              |
|  Three components, three roles: water the solvent, NH3 the cation route       |
|  (its declared bridge is NH4+ minus H+), CO2 the anion route (HCO3-, CO3--)   |
|  and at the same time the aqueous molecular species CO2aq.                    |
|                                                                              |
|  NH3 and CO2 are fed in different amounts on purpose: an equimolar feed       |
|  would close the charge balance by symmetry and hide a sign error.            |
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
componentMolarFlows
{
    NH3       1.5   kmol/h;
    CO2       0.8   kmol/h;
    water    96.0   kmol/h;
}

T               350.0 K;
P               101325 Pa;
